OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry morning with sunny
OL,6,Fspells. Becoming cloudier in the
OL,7,Fafternoon with a few light showers
OL,8,Facross the west and north. Staying dry
OL,9,Felsewhere. Drier, brighter again in
OL,10,Fthe evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAny showers will clear to
OL,13,Fleave a mainly dry evening. The rest
OL,14,Fof the night will then remain dry
OL,15,Facross all parts with some clear
OL,16,Fperiods. Turning rather chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
