OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA dry and bright morning with
OL,6,Fsunny intervals. Turning cloudier
OL,7,Fthrough the afternoon, with the chance
OL,8,Fof a few spots of rain during the
OL,9,Fevening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FBecoming widely unsettled from Monday,
OL,13,Fwith rain spreading northwards, at
OL,14,Ftimes heavy and persistent. Further
OL,15,Fspells of rain or showers are likely
OL,16,Fon Tuesday and Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
